cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "SAA POES Mapping: analysis choices and orbital sampling of a particle-defined South Atlantic Anomaly footprint"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, data provenance and manuscript for a single-month (January 2024)
  methodological case study of how a percentile-defined South Atlantic Anomaly footprint,
  mapped from NOAA/NCEI POES/MetOp SEM-2 MEPED omnidirectional proton fluxes, depends on
  threshold, cell statistic and grid, proton channel, accumulation window and spacecraft.
authors:
